{"seq":2,"slug":"conventions-and-gotchas","title":"约定与坑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/writing-effective-context/conventions-and-gotchas","wordCount":1935,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"约定与坑\">约定与坑</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>约定与坑是上下文文件里性价比最高的两类内容，原因很朴素：<strong>它们恰好是代码里读不出来、只存在于老成员脑子和聊天记录里的隐性知识</strong>。包管理器混用会出什么乱子、命名背后的分层意图、「这个命令必须先跑那个」的隐藏前置——agent 每一项都可能猜错，而且错了往往比普通 bug 更难收拾：违反约定的 diff 可能功能正常却过不了 review，踩中雷区的改动可能波及看不见的下游模块。把这两类内容显式写进上下文文件，本质上是把组织经验一次性序列化，交付给每一个新来的 agent 和新人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「约定」与「坑」是两类内容，却共享同一个入选理由：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>约定</strong>：可机械验证的团队规矩（包管理器、导出风格、行数上限、流程与命名），落到可判定的粒度才可执行。</li>\n<li><strong>坑</strong>：代码里读不出、跑挂才知道的雷区与隐藏前置——“这个命令要先跑那个”“改了这里会连带影响 X”。</li>\n<li><strong>共同的入选判据</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot p \\cdot C_{fix} &gt; C_{write}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——触发次数 × 触发概率 × 修复代价 大于 一次性书写成本。</li>\n<li><strong>一句话 why</strong>：关键约定与坑都应附上原因，让 agent 理解而非死记，规则过期时才会被发现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>「反复被踩的坑」天然满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 高、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{fix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大，因而最容易通过这条检验——沉淀应从踩坑记录开始。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么它们最值得先写\">为什么它们最值得先写</h2><p>用成本摊销的视角可以看得更清楚（原创综合）：写一条坑的成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{write}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一次性的，而它阻止的是每次触发概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 乘以修复代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{fix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的重复损失。只要</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot p \\cdot C_{fix} &gt; C_{write}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为未来的触发次数），这条记录就值得存在。「反复被踩的坑」天然满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 高、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{fix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大，是最容易通过这条检验的一批内容——这也是为什么沉淀应该从踩坑记录开始，而不是从想象中的「最佳实践」开始。</p>\n<p>官方文档里有三个可引用的佐证：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>agents.md 官网把 Security considerations 与 security gotchas 列入推荐分区，并把收录标准表述为「anything you&#39;d tell a new teammate」；</li>\n<li>Claude Code 文档明确警告：两条互相矛盾的规则会让 Claude <strong>任意挑一条执行</strong>（may pick one arbitrarily），所以新踩的坑若与旧约定冲突，必须显式裁决而非并存（来源：<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">code.claude.com/docs/en/memory</a>）；</li>\n<li>Codex 官方指南的完整示例中，支付团队的差异化规则放在 <code>services/payments/AGENTS.override.md</code>——团队间约定分歧是工程常态，工具层早已为此准备了机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"写约定-选型-命名-流程-外加一句-why\">写约定：选型、命名、流程，外加一句 why</h2><p>有效的约定段落有三个特征。第一，<strong>落到可判定的粒度</strong>：本仓库 AGENTS.md 写的是「只用 pnpm——绝不 npm 或 yarn」「只用命名导出——绝不 export default」「源码无注释」「文件 ≤ 200 行（硬上限 300）」，每条都能机械验证；对比之下「保持代码整洁」无法执行，也就无法遵守。第二，<strong>覆盖流程而不只是风格</strong>：怎么加依赖、怎么提交、改了 X 要不要同步改 Y——agents.md 官网示例甚至规定了 PR 标题格式 <code>[&lt;project_name&gt;] &lt;Title&gt;</code>，并要求提交前 lint/test 全绿。第三，<strong>关键约定附一句为什么</strong>：让 agent 理解而非死记，遇到规则没写到的情况才能做出与意图一致的判断；死记的规则一旦过期就是误导，理解的规则过期了会被发现。</p>\n<p>约定的数量本身也要克制。每条约定都是对 agent 注意力的一次抽取，而 Claude 文档的矛盾警告意味着清单越长、自相矛盾的概率越高，审查成本随条目数非线性上升。一条可用的分界线：能机械判定的写（包管理器、导出风格、行数上限），需要品味判断的不写——后者属于 code review 的职责，塞进上下文文件只会制造无法执行的噪音。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写坑-把雷区变成显式警告\">写坑：把雷区变成显式警告</h2><p>坑的写法决定它是否真的被遵守：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>禁区用强标记隔离</strong>：单独成节、以 <code>禁止</code> 或 ⚠️ 开头，不要混在散文段落里——被忽略的警告等于没写。</li>\n<li><strong>写清隐藏前置与连带影响</strong>：「这个命令要先跑那个」「改了这里会连带影响 X」属于典型的「代码里看不出、跑挂才知道」，是上下文文件独有的价值。</li>\n<li><strong>从反复发生的错误反推</strong>：agent 或人重复踩的地方就是最高信号的补录来源。</li>\n<li><strong>前置条件用完整条件句式写</strong>。agents.md 官网的示例文件给出了标准范式：「After moving files or changing imports, run <code>pnpm lint --filter &lt;project_name&gt;</code>」——触发条件、动作、目的三要素齐全，agent 可以直接照做；只写「注意 lint」则等于没写。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;agent 或人踩坑&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;复盘归因&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;值得显式化？&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;一次性事故&quot;| D[&quot;不写&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;可复发&quot;| E[&quot;写入最近的适用层级&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;agent 避开&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;定期复审&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;规则过期&quot;| H[&quot;删除或改写&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;仍然成立&quot;| E\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"agent 或人踩坑\"] --&gt; B[\"复盘归因\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"值得显式化？\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"一次性事故\"| D[\"不写\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"可复发\"| E[\"写入最近的适用层级\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"agent 避开\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"定期复审\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"规则过期\"| H[\"删除或改写\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"仍然成立\"| E</pre><p>每次人工纠正 agent 之后顺手问一句「这条是否该进上下文文件」，是成本最低的沉淀回路——纠正发生在现场，事后补写会丢失关键细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"放置与显眼度-机制层的权衡\">放置与显眼度：机制层的权衡</h2><p>写在哪一层与写什么同样重要，因为各工具的装载语义并不相同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>放置方式</th>\n<th>生效范围</th>\n<th>装载时机</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仓库根 AGENTS.md</td>\n<td>全仓库</td>\n<td>会话启动时</td>\n<td>与子包特化冲突时被子目录文件压过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子目录 AGENTS.override.md</td>\n<td>仅该目录（Codex）</td>\n<td>启动时逐目录择一</td>\n<td>同目录 AGENTS.md 整个被忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.claude/rules/*.md</code> 带 <code>paths:</code> frontmatter</td>\n<td>匹配 glob 的文件</td>\n<td>读到匹配文件才装载</td>\n<td>漏写 frontmatter 则变成全程在场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个工具级的陷阱值得单独点名。其一，Codex 在每个目录最多取一个指令文件，<code>AGENTS.override.md</code> 存在时同目录的基础文件直接失效——官方示例的原话是「Ignored because an override exists」。临时 override 用完不删，全队就会在不知情的情况下失去基础指引。其二，Gemini CLI 的 JIT 发现机制意味着模块级警告会在访问现场才进入上下文，适合放「只在动那个模块时有意义」的内容；把它们提升到根文件只会浪费全局预算（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/blob/main/docs/cli/gemini-md.md\">gemini-cli 文档</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li>新接手一个仓库时，先验证装载结果再谈遵守：Codex 用「Summarize the current instructions.」让 agent 复述生效链，Gemini CLI 用 <code>/memory show</code> 查看完整拼接内容，Claude Code 用 <code>/memory</code> 查看。</li>\n<li>把「纠错即沉淀」变成固定动作：每次纠正 agent 后判断是否新增或修订一条约定/坑，当场写入最近的适用层级。</li>\n<li>周期性扫矛盾：Claude 文档建议定期审查嵌套文件与 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 目录，清除过期和互相冲突的条目，否则 Claude 会在矛盾中任意站队。</li>\n<li>monorepo 中无关团队的规则文件会污染装载结果，可用 <code>claudeMdExcludes</code> 排除指定 CLAUDE.md。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>约定与坑站在三重交集上：代码读不出 × 错了代价大 × 反复触发，因此天然通过价值检验。写法上做到可判定、带 why、禁区显眼；放置上利用就近覆盖与按需装载两个机制，同时警惕 override 遮蔽与矛盾并存这两个静默失效的模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"what-to-put-in-agents\">AGENTS.md 该写什么</a>：内容选择的总纲与价值公式——约定与坑为何天然通过检验。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../maintaining-context-files/context-from-recurring-mistakes\">从反复出错反推该补什么</a>：坑的最高信号来源——把「纠错即沉淀」变成制度化回路。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约定与坑","id":"约定与坑"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么它们最值得先写","id":"为什么它们最值得先写"},{"level":2,"text":"写约定：选型、命名、流程，外加一句 why","id":"写约定-选型-命名-流程-外加一句-why"},{"level":2,"text":"写坑：把雷区变成显式警告","id":"写坑-把雷区变成显式警告"},{"level":2,"text":"放置与显眼度：机制层的权衡","id":"放置与显眼度-机制层的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"AGENTS.md 该写什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/writing-effective-context/what-to-put-in-agents"},"next":{"title":"保持精炼","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/writing-effective-context/keeping-it-concise"}}